{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29127","headline":"将归姑苏南楼饯送李明府 · 许浑","name":"将归姑苏南楼饯送李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无处登临不系情，一凭春酒醉高城。\n暂移罗绮见山色，才驻管弦闻水声。\n花落西亭添别恨，柳阴南浦促归程。\n前期迢遰今宵短，更倚朱阑待月明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}